  "description": "For the past four years, Hye-Yeong has been juggling three jobs to pay off her father’s debt, all while single-handedly caring for her younger sister—never missing a single payment. But just as she’s on the verge of finally breaking free, her life takes an unexpected turn when she crosses paths with Ji Joo-Chan, the enigmatic executive director of Shinwon Finance.\n\nIs her luck finally about to change? Or will she be dragged into his dark world instead?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
